  "title": "sharkd: Restore printing detailed UAT pref error message",
  "description": "Commit 647205177179a6e9ef6c08f08c33a2b405efffbc removed printing\nin sharkd the detailed error message for setting UAT preferences that\nwas added in c9b0e9c81335e098cdb256b1c58597cda96703b1\n\nCauses sharkd to produce more useful error messages for UATs:\n\n{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\", \"id\":1, \"method\":\"setconf\",\"params\":{\"name\": \"uat:ssl_keys\", \"value\": \"\\\"192.168.168.110\\\", \\\"443\\\", \\\"http\\\", \\\"/etc/nginx/cert/server.key\\\", \\\"\\\" \"}}\n\n{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"error\":{\"code\":-4005,\"message\":\"Unable to set the preference: ssl_keys:1: File '/etc/nginx/cert/server.key' does not exist or access is denied.\"}}\n\n{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\", \"id\":1, \"method\":\"setconf\",\"params\":{\"name\": \"uat:ssl_keys\", \"value\": \"\\\"192.168.168.110\\\", \\\"443\\\", \\\"http\\\" \"}}\n\n{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"error\":{\"code\":-4005,\"message\":\"Unable to set the preference: ssl_keys:1: expecting field keyfile\"}}\n\nPing #19562, #20292",
